A `GET /api/trips/[id]/itinerary.pdf` download route can reuse the same render function at almost no extra cost.

## Decisions

| Question | Recommendation | Why |
|---|---|---|
| PDF rendering | `@react-pdf/renderer` | It is pure JS and runs in a serverless function. Headless Chrome (Puppeteer) gives HTML/CSS fidelity but is heavy and awkward on serverless hosts. |
